# Momentum Stock Agent Architecture

## System Context

```mermaid
C4Context
    title Momentum Stock Agent - System Context

    Person(user, "Trader / Operator", "Starts pipeline, reviews alerts, executes trades")
    System(agent_system, "Momentum Stock Agent System", "Multi-agent pipeline: extracts watchlist, scans, analyzes, alerts, records trades")

    System_Ext(extraction_src, "Watchlist Sources", "TradingView, StockTwits, WhaleWisdom, Congress API")
    System_Ext(market_data, "Market Data", "Yahoo Finance (yfinance), FMP API, Alpha Vantage")
    System_Ext(llm, "Foundry Local LLM", "phi-4-mini for CANSLIM scoring")
